NO --> UC40

' ── Auditor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Read-only roaming (PERM_roaming-events:read)
AUD --> UC05
AUD --> UC07
AUD --> UC08
AUD --> UC13
' Read-only security alerts (PERM_security-alerts:read)
AUD --> UC15
AUD --> UC16
' Read-only NF status (PERM_nf:read)
AUD --> UC20
' Audit (PERM_audit:read)
AUD --> UC35
AUD --> UC36
AUD --> UC37
AUD --> UC38
' Observability
AUD --> UC39

' ── Scheduler (system) ───────────────────────────────────────
SCHED --> UC41
SCHED --> UC42
SCHED --> UC43
SCHED --> UC44

' ── External systems ─────────────────────────────────────────
F5GC --> UC20
F5GC --> UC21
UER  --> UC20

@enduml
